    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Convent Gardens has proven to be a very popular development of luxury properties including apartments, townhouses and detached homes in the grounds of the former Mercy Convent perched high on the hill overlooking Kinsale town. The Cumnor development is within a couple of minutes walk from the centre of Kinsale town and harbour making it an ideal location for those seeking a modern comfortable home, in pristine condition close to the heart of everything. \n\n9 Spanish Walk has an ideal east-west orientation with the front of the property enjoying the morning sunshine and the terrace to the rear enjoying afternoon and evening sunshine. There is off-street parking for two cars to the front of the property which is finished with cobble-block paving and mature planting to the edges. The accommodation is spacious throughout and offers open plan living / kitchen / dining on the ground floor with direct access to the rear garden. The entrance hall has a spacious guest wc. The first floor has two fine double bedrooms, both with fitted wardrobes and doors opening to Juliet balconies; and the family bathroom completes this level. The top floor has a spacious light filled main bedroom with dormer window and Velux window to the front, ample fitted wardrobes and a well appointed en suite shower-room.\n\nThe A-rated property benefits from an air to water heat pump system and has a wood burning stove in the livingroom. There is a very useful shed in the rear garden. \n\n9 Spanish Walk is an ideal full time home and will also work really well as a lockup and leave bolt-hole or weekend property with everything Kinsale offers on it`s doorstep."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
