        "Content": "<ul><li> A-rated property in very attractive development in the grounds of former convent </li><li> 3-bedroomed/3-bathroomed spacious accommodation </li><li> private off-street parking for two cars </li><li> open plan living space/kitchen with direct access to garden </li><li> walking distance of Kinsale town and harbour</li></ul>"
